lian inherits a minor-league football club from a long-lost uncle. He decides to visit the club to sell it, but the local population has other ideas: through an almost-armed uprising they \"force\" him not to sell the club but lead it to other glories on the football field."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUTwInnbm1zmKvg4i38IkTLijjF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uptblwLfDRpFJez3m0117q3pOo0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":73753,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUTwInnbm1zmKvg4i38IkTLijjF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uUTwInnbm1zmKvg4i38IkTLijjF.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUTwInnbm1zmKvg4i38IkTLijjF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uUTwInnbm1zmKvg4i38IkTLijjF.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ycGyjDITyGeTnwx0UNJgDmINcNd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ycGyjDITyGeTnwx0UNJgDmINcNd.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qtBN5bmzM2rmgQTkDzgGOphOAtH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qtBN5bmzM2rmgQTkDzgGOphOAtH.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iN4pQUTlxjeD4UaIZ8z2KtKt0rv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iN4pQUTlxjeD4UaIZ8z2KtKt0rv.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w6Iyjfyn8PVrwI0iS37xgXNVx8Z.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w6Iyjfyn8PVrwI0iS37xgXNVx8Z.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"ty